{"title": "Lupperdiddle Swires", "pageid": 50406, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lupperdiddle_Swires", "categories": ["Mentioned characters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>\n<b>Lupperdiddle Swires</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Gnome\" title=\"Gnome\">gnomish</a> adventurer, who is mentioned on several occasions in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Swires is famed for their ability to leap extraordinarily high. The party can find some pieces of equpiment and other items, which are somehow connected with Swires.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_items\">Related items</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arsonist%27s_Oil\" title=\"Arsonist's Oil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Coa